  "description": {
    "text": "The cards Hot Topic in the United States gave away with Pokémon TCG purchases, the same ones Barnes & Noble gave: Reshiram with the Phantasmal Flames logo, Aurorus with the Perfect Order logo and Keldeo with the Chaos Rising logo, for its launch on 22 May 2026, when BoxLunch gave it too. For the 30th anniversary of Pokémon the three chains gave Primarina with the \"What's Your Favorite?\" logo.",
